COMMENT arrow_mini.bdf
COMMENT
COMMENT U8G2GL — declarative UI for U8G2 monochrome displays
COMMENT Copyright (c) 2026 Matt McNeill (CB Labs)
COMMENT SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
COMMENT
COMMENT A hand-written three-glyph BDF fixture (PR-04b WO3b item 3): one glyph
COMMENT below 0x20, one in ASCII, and one above 0xFF, so <bdf> with no `range`
COMMENT reaches every one of them — the absent-range fix's own proof.
STARTFONT 2.1
FONT -cblabs-arrowmini-medium-r-normal--7-70-75-75-c-50-iso10646-1
SIZE 7 75 75
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 5 7 0 -1

STARTPROPERTIES 6
FOUNDRY "CBLabs"
FAMILY_NAME "ArrowMini"
WEIGHT_NAME "Medium"
SLANT "R"
PIXEL_SIZE 7
DEFAULT_CHAR 65
ENDPROPERTIES

CHARS 3

STARTCHAR ctrl_bell
ENCODING 7
SWIDTH 714 0
DWIDTH 5 0
BBX 5 7 0 -1
BITMAP
00
70
70
70
00
00
00
ENDCHAR

STARTCHAR A
ENCODING 65
SWIDTH 714 0
DWIDTH 5 0
BBX 5 7 0 -1
BITMAP
20
50
50
70
50
50
00
ENDCHAR

STARTCHAR arrowleft
ENCODING 8592
SWIDTH 714 0
DWIDTH 5 0
BBX 5 7 0 -1
BITMAP
00
20
40
F8
40
20
00
ENDCHAR

ENDFONT
